{"id":"c34567ee085049be","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-hornmin.md","title":"Existence of a minimum-term Horn DNF","display":"thm-hornmin — Existence of a minimum-term Horn DNF","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-hornmin","aliases":["27-thm-hornmin"],"display":"thm-hornmin — Existence of a minimum-term Horn DNF","depends_on":["[[27-df-horndnf]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-hornmin"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-hornmin</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hornmin — Existence of a minimum-term Horn DNF"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4ef7bb7896ef8f96\" href=\"?note=4ef7bb7896ef8f96\" title=\"27-df-horndnf\">27-df-horndnf</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n\\)</span> is defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ef7bb7896ef8f96\" href=\"?note=4ef7bb7896ef8f96\" title=\"27-df-horndnf\">27-df-horndnf</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n\\;\\exists D_*\\in\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D_*)=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E)=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\to|D_*|\\le|E|)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n\\;\\exists D_*\\in\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D_*)=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E)=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\to|D_*|\\le|E|)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地有限性证明：一致文字集至多 3^n 个，故候选 Horn DNFs 的族有限非空，项数取得最小值。来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §6.7, Horn τ-minimization，印刷页 297–300，PDF 第 321–324 页（从 1 计数）。 这里只保证最小值存在，不宣称可多项式求得；原书 Theorem 6.17 明确讨论该优化的 NP 完全性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-horndnf","status":"resolved","id":"4ef7bb7896ef8f96","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-horndnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DNF}_n$ and $\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ are as in [[27-df-dnf]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-horndnf","status":"resolved","id":"4ef7bb7896ef8f96","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n$ is defined in [[27-df-horndnf]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n:\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\to\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall D\\in\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n\\;\\exists D_*\\in\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n\\;\\left(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D_*)=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathrm{HornDNF}_n\\;(\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(E)=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\to|D_*|\\le|E|)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1258,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-439","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-hornmin|thm-hornmin — Existence of a minimum-term Horn DNF]]"}],"outgoing":["4ef7bb7896ef8f96","5d10aed668d85817","0b618255959ff4bc"]}